OL,3,GNEWSAFertility policy change a         
OL,4,A'priority', says NHS care board        
OL,6,FFigures published by National Institute
OL,7,Ffor Health and Care Excellence (NICE)  
OL,8,Fin March showed only 11 of England's 42
OL,9,FICBs funded more than one IVF cycle.   
OL,10,FNICE recommends an initial three full  
OL,11,Fcycles for eligible patients under 40. 
